   CC BY 4.0: the messages sent to the model are the original prompts, verbatim (every message.txt and the first
   turns/t001/prompt.txt of each conversation; harness/exp4/prompt.txt, harness/exp5/prompts/, harness/exp7/prompts/).
   They contain the original networks' weights as text (Experiments 1, 2, 4) and the original task descriptions.
   The scorers read the original answer keys from that repository; they are not copied here.

4. MinAtar's source code, quoted inside the prompts of Experiment 5 (<run>/exp5_write_from_scratch/runs/*/message.txt
